# RPost workflow

- The only content stages are topic and post.
- Topics live in `topics/index.json`; posts live in `content/drafts/*.qmd`.
- Read shared prompts through `prompt-rules/index.json`.
- Generate a post directly from a selected topic ID or free-form subject.
- Preserve explicit user-provided headings, order, examples, and output requirements; they override prompt defaults.
- Use `articleId` to distinguish candidate and written topics.
- Do not add scheduling, queue, rank, or automatic daily writing fields.
- Follow the full repository contract in `AGENTS.md`.
